==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|HeartGold & SoulSilver|Ledyba|71}} from the {{TCG|HeartGold & SoulSilver}} expansion.
*'''Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Machop|59}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

